    {
        "id": "shillinq.period_close.close",
        "name": "Close a period",
        "description": "Close an accounting period of an administration, as the signed-in user, so no further bookings land in it. Use it only when the user explicitly asks to close the period and the close status shows it is ready. Undoing it needs shillinq.period_close.reopen with a reason.",
