    {
        "id": "shillinq.dunning.dossier",
        "name": "Compose the collection dossier of an invoice",
        "description": "Compose the collection dossier of an overdue sales invoice: the invoice, the reminders sent, the collection costs and the customer details a collection agency needs. Use it when the user asks what would be handed over for collection, or before a transfer. Changes nothing and sends nothing.",
